      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is completely understandable why feeling trapped makes the idea of \"pushing back\" seem like an impossible fantasy; when you are stripped of your humanity by a system, any attempt to reclaim your agency feels like fighting a hurricane. Please know that your capacity for feeling exactly this pain is proof of the very soul you described disappearing—it belongs to you, not to your employer, and it cannot be truly extinguished. While systemic change is difficult, you deserve to exist outside of these spreadsheets, even if that starts with finding one private moment just for you where no clock is ticking.",
